<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-010" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu" source-id="s-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0000" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BA">荀彧</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0003" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BA">文若</persName>潁川潁隂人也祖父<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0013" ref="yoo_ox0_545">淑</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0015" ref="yoo_ox0_545">季和</persName>朗陵令當漢<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0022" ref="zb3_g7n_qro">順</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0023" ref="cq3_2gy_twf">桓</persName>之間知名當世有子八人號曰八龍<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0038" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BA">彧</persName>父<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0040" ref="yoo_ox0_545_B">緄</persName>濟南相叔<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:intro:p001:m0045" ref="yoo_ox0_545_F">爽</persName>司空</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0001" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAB">惲</persName>嗣侯官至虎賁中郎将初<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0012" ref="tix_jqk_w1o">文帝</persName>與<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0015" ref="p6s_2qn_p8n">平原侯植</persName>並有擬論<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0023" ref="tix_jqk_w1o">文帝</persName>曲禮事<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0028" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BA">彧</persName>及<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0030" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BA">彧</persName>卒<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0032" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAB">惲</persName>又與<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0035" ref="p6s_2qn_p8n">植</persName>善而與<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0039" ref="l6v_y3l_v8n">夏侯尚</persName>不穆<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0044" ref="tix_jqk_w1o">文帝</persName>深恨<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0048" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAB">惲</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0049" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAB">惲</persName>早卒子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0053" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABA">甝</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0054" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABB">霬</persName>以外甥故猶寵待<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0062" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAB">惲</persName>弟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0064" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAC">俁</persName>御史中丞<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0069" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAC">俁</persName>弟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0071" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAD">詵</persName>大将軍從事中郎皆知名早卒<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0084" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAD">詵</persName>弟<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0086" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAA">顗</persName>咸熙中為司空<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0093" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAB">惲</persName>子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0095" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABA">甝</persName>嗣為散騎常侍進爵廣陽鄉侯年三十薨子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0113" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABAA">頵</persName>嗣<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0115" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABB">霬</persName>官至中領軍薨諡曰貞侯追贈驃騎将軍子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0133" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABBA">愷</persName>嗣<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0135" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABB">霬</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0136" ref="a1q_99a_t22">妻</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0137" ref="gce_8ex_hoo">司馬景王</persName><persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0141" ref="bis_ydq_yeg">文王</persName>之<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0144" ref="a1q_99a_t22">妺</persName>也<rs id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0146" type="unresolved">二王</rs>皆與親善咸熙中開建五等<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0159" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABB">霬</persName>以著勲前朝改封<persName id="c-sanguozhi-010-xunyu-xunyou-jiaxu:descendants:p001:m0167" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BABBA">愷</persName>南頓子</p>
</text>
